      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f465dd8d9b7356021eb6b52|full_name}: This issue as a whole should now be fixed on live, but you may notice that your specific avatar is still broken - this is actually another issue. It is unclear why it behaves differently in Unity 2022, but the way it behaves now seems more correct so it is unlikely we will continue to work on this.\n\nAs seen in the screenshot, one of your particle sources has a \"gravity modifier\" of 0.3, which causes it to turn downwards naturally. Setting this to 0, in combination with the latest updates we shipped, should restore that avatar to a working state.\n\nLet me know if this fixes it, or if there is a different issue lurking here.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
