      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}: This indeed fixed the avatar! As well as 4 other instances where I have used this semi-auto buffer particle setup on an avatar which had identical problems (all of them firing downward). Thank you very much for the suggestion! \n\nProbably down to just a difference in how the gravity modifier works between versions. At any rate, I updated the previously linked avatar with the fix. But I uploaded a separate version that maintains this previous behavior in-case you'd want to investigate whatever this separate problem may be:\n\n**avtr_4c6bdab3-5195-4f48-98ad-97bcd72c9236**",
